{"id":"G2026","lemma":"ἐποικοδομέω","transliteration":"epoikodomeō","sayIt":"epoikodomeō","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"verb","gloss":"to build up/upon","meaning":"ἐπ-οικοδομέω, -ῶ\nin NT, always metaphorically, of the spiritual life regarded as a building (Cremer, 449);\n1. to build upon: 1Co.3:10 3:12 3:14; pass., Eph.2:20.\n2. to build up: Col.2:7, 1Pe.2:5 (T, οἰκοδ- WH, Rec.), Ju 20.†\n(AS)","glosses":["building on it","builds","what he has built","built","built up","building"],"count":6,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1co-3","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"is building on it","kjv":"uildeth"}},{"chapterId":"1co-3","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"builds","kjv":"build"}},{"chapterId":"1co-3","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"what he has built","kjv":"he hath built"}},{"chapterId":"eph-2","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"built","kjv":"And are built"}},{"chapterId":"col-2","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"built up","kjv":"built up"}},{"chapterId":"jud-1","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"by building","kjv":"building up"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Corinthians 3:10","note":"According to the grace of God which was given to me, as a wise master builder I laid a foundation, and another builds on it. But let each man be careful how he…","source":"web"},{"ref":"Ephesians 2:20","note":"being built on the foundation of the apostles and prophets, Christ Jesus himself being the chief cornerstone;","source":"web"},{"ref":"Colossians 2:7","note":"rooted and built up in him, and established in the faith, even as you were taught, abounding in it in thanksgiving.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Jude 1:20","note":"But you, beloved, keep building up yourselves on your most holy faith, praying in the Holy Spirit.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"G20260","lemma":"δορατοφόρος","transliteration":"doratophoros","gloss":"spear-carrying"},{"id":"G20261","lemma":"δορυφορία","transliteration":"doruphoria","gloss":"body-guard"},{"id":"G20262","lemma":"δράκος","transliteration":"drakos","gloss":"eye"},{"id":"G20263","lemma":"δυνάστευμα","transliteration":"dunasteuma","gloss":"natural resources"},{"id":"G20264","lemma":"δυσάθλιος","transliteration":"dusathlios","gloss":"most miserable"},{"id":"G20265","lemma":"δυσάλυκτος","transliteration":"dusaluktos","gloss":"hard to escape"},{"id":"G20266","lemma":"δυσδιήγητος","transliteration":"dusdiēgētos","gloss":"hard to narrate"},{"id":"G20267","lemma":"δυσκατάπαυστος","transliteration":"duskatapaustos","gloss":"restless"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}